4. Confidentiality and safeguards

To the extent the Materials are not lawfully publicly available and you receive
them under circumstances creating a duty of confidentiality, you must:

- use them solely for the authorized Mindclade purpose;
- restrict access to authorized persons with a need to know and equivalent
  confidentiality obligations;
- protect them using at least reasonable administrative, technical, and
  physical safeguards;
- not disclose them to any third party without Mindclade, LLC.'s prior written
  authorization; and
- promptly report suspected loss, misuse, or unauthorized access or disclosure
